  triage:findingId "R17-FTQ-002" ;
  triage:title "Fixed thread::sleep in watch_runtime.rs test code" ;
  triage:description "In crates/atm-daemon/src/watch_runtime.rs test section, lines 466 and 476 use std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(200)) and sleep(Duration::from_millis(220)). Fixed sleeps in tests cause timing-dependent failures on slow CI. Should use event-driven synchronization instead." ;
